# @name: docker | Run Container with Port Mapping
# @description: Runs a container with port mapping Group: Docker Container Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {host_port} = Host port to map [default "8080"] | {container_port} = Container port to map [default "80"] | {container_name} = Name for the container | {image_name} = Docker image to run
docker run -d -p {host_port}:{container_port} --name {container_name} {image_name}